From 436e66f537162c422a02c8dafd02ab4ecc12efbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fxzx micah <48860358+fxzxmicah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:06:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Use /etc/dnf/repos.d for system repository configuration

Keep repository configuration under /etc/dnf alongside the main configuration and repository overrides. Update the default search path and Copr destination, and create the directory during installation.

Align the documentation and existing test fixtures and expectations with the new layout. Retain the separate distribution and vendor repository directories.
